status: accept
exit: 42
covers: data_decl variant
note: |
  A named sum type (the dual of place): `inductive Name = C0 | C1(args) | ...`.
  The name lets a constructor argument refer to the type it defines, so this is
  how a genuinely recursive inductive is written. Built with hit(Ctor, args),
  consumed with match/hit_elim; at runtime a value is a content-addressed
  MerkleTree node (constructor = tag, arguments = children).
